# Model artifacts are stored as ordinary git blobs, not Git LFS — the largest
# is 22 MB against GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, and LFS meant every build
# system had to remember to fetch it or silently get pointer stubs.
# `binary` (= -diff -merge -text) keeps them out of EOL normalisation, which
# the old `-text` flag was doing.
*.pkl binary
*.keras binary
